OL,3,ARunning costs of vaccine damage scheme
OL,4,Amore than double amount paid to victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government scheme to support people
OL,7,Finjured by Covid vaccines and other
OL,8,Fjabs has cost #83m to run since April
OL,9,F2022, new figures have revealed.
OL,11,FThe amount spent on administration
OL,12,Fcosts and medical assessments is more
OL,13,Fthan double the #32m paid out in
OL,14,Ffinancial support to victims so far.
OL,16,FThe Taxpayers' Alliance think tank said
OL,17,Fthe public would be "stunned" at the
OL,18,Fcost and called for the government to
OL,19,Furgently review the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
