OL,3,ARunning costs of vaccine damage scheme
OL,4,Amore than double amount paid to victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHSBSA which runs the scheme for the
OL,7,Fgovernment says rising numbers of
OL,8,Fclaims are behind the increasing
OL,9,Fadministrative and medical assessor
OL,10,Fsupplier costs.
